  "description": "Ji Sun-Jeong knows exactly how cruel the world can be, especially for an omega scraping by at the absolute bottom. But nothing prepares him for the night he steps into a dark alley and watches the city’s most beloved billionaire philanthropist, Beom Seong-Heon, brutally beat a man half to death. Disgusted by the alpha’s saintly facade, Sun-Jeong decides to leverage the secret in order to secure his freedom. Surprisingly, Seong-Heon easily plays along, opening his wallet and pulling Sun-Jeong into his orbit. But Seong-Heon isn't without his own reasons. Both believe they hold the leash in this toxic game of mutual exploitation, but as their cold-blooded transaction spirals into a breathless attraction, the line between hunter and prey begins to vanish...\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
